# Two of the fallback states, overridden. The first message mentions '<' in its
# prose, which must not count as a delimiter hint in `stele stats`; the second
# carries a real one.
main: INT LPAREN
Expecting ';' or an operator, such as '+' or '<'.

main: LPAREN INT LPAREN
Expecting ')' or an operator.
<2>This '(' opens the enclosing construct.
